<title>UK: CRICKET-KENT TAKE LEAD OF 120 OVER AUSTRALIA AT CLOSER.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-KENT TAKE LEAD OF 120 OVER AUSTRALIA AT CLOSER.</headline>
<dateline>CANTERBURY, England 1997-08-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kent were 234 for five wickets at close of play, a lead of 120 over Australia, on the second day of a three-day match on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores: Kent 201 and 234-5 (T.Ward 68, A.Wells 65), Australia 315 (S.Waugh 154, M.Bevan 55).</p>
